  follow-up cross-link metric upgrade — distinguish 'cited-by-anchor' (live rule citing this) vs 'cited-by-emergent' (new/warn citing this) for absorption priority weighting
  follow-up category fallback strengthening — 6/11 own entries hit 'uncategorized' bucket (own 1/2/3/7/8/9/10 lack explicit category line); follow-up: backfill explicit category fields per audit-pass refinement OR enrich slug→category heuristic
